#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:576
#, php-format
msgid "This is the starting value for a new registration. It can be changed per %s afterwards."
msgstr "Dies ist der Startwert für eine neue Registrierung. Er lässt sich danach je %s ändern."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:590
msgid "What happens to the plugin's data when it is deleted from the Plugins screen."
